Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 06:17:04 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 93/97] Always-on freeze logger: 1 Hz watchdog (no present for
 10 s after the first) + lock-free 4096-entry kernel sync-event ring (123
 ns/push); one report per freeze in the logs folder (threads, wait objects,
 host backtraces, ring, last 200 log lines); WWE2K14_FREEZE_LOG=0 disables,
 WWE2K14_FREEZE_TEST_BLOCK test hook

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
